---
title: SDP — System Directed Put Flow
---
flowchart TD
    START([Worker opens SDP\nsrc/pages/SDPPage.tsx]) --> S1

    S1[State: entry\naisleField auto-focuses\nSize override: all roles\nStorage Code/Zone override: IM+ only]

    S1 --> AISLE[Worker enters Aisle number\nhandleAisleConfirm\nfocus moves to palletField]

    AISLE --> PALLET_SCAN{Scan Pallet ID\nhandlePalletScan}

    PALLET_SCAN --> VALIDATE{Aisle entered?}
    VALIDATE -->|No aisle| NOOP[Field disabled\nno action]
    VALIDATE -->|Aisle present| API_DIR

    API_DIR[POST /api/puts/directed\napi/functions/puts.ts — directedPut\ncheckPalletEligibility\nresolveEffectiveCriteria\nStorage Code/Size exact-match, Zone soft-pref\nfindNextLocation — zone asc, bin desc, level asc\nwith Zone-1 fallback retry\nCreate Reservation row incl. wasStaged]

    API_DIR --> DIR_OK{Result?}
    DIR_OK -->|PALLET_NOT_FOUND| ERR_P1[Error: Pallet not found\npalletField kept — re-focused for retry]
    DIR_OK -->|CANCELED| ERR_P4[Error: Pallet canceled\npalletField kept — re-focused for retry]
    DIR_OK -->|BLOCKED_BY_PENDING_PULL| ERR_P5[Error: Open Container pending\npalletField kept — re-focused for retry]
    DIR_OK -->|NO_CARTONS| ERR_P2[Error: No stored cartons\npalletField kept — re-focused for retry]
    DIR_OK -->|NO_LOCATIONS| ERR_P3[Error: No eligible locations\nin requested aisle\npalletField kept — re-focused for retry]
    DIR_OK -->|OK| DIR_RESULT[Returns reservationId\ndirectedLocation\npallet details\nalreadyStored flag]

    ERR_P1 --> S1
    ERR_P4 --> S1
    ERR_P5 --> S1
    ERR_P2 --> S1
    ERR_P3 --> S1

    DIR_RESULT --> MOVE_CHECK{alreadyStored?}
    MOVE_CHECK -->|Yes + consolidating| INFO_MSG[Info: move scenario\nshown in message bar]
    MOVE_CHECK -->|Yes, not consolidating| WARN_MSG[Warning: move scenario\nshown in message bar]
    MOVE_CHECK -->|No| S2

    INFO_MSG --> S2
    WARN_MSG --> S2

    S2[State: directed\nSDPVerifyPutModal opens — screen-blocking popup, #151\nbackdrop covers entry-state content behind it\nshows directed-to location + Storage Code/Size badges\ndirectedLocationSize branches the body:\nRack !== XS — Pallet ID/Item/DPCI/Confirm Location only\nHand === XS — adds Carton Quantity + Exists Elsewhere\nhasReservation = true\n5-min server-side timer pushes expiry to screen\nvia polling, not on next scan attempt]

    S2 --> ACTION{Worker action?}

    ACTION -->|Confirm Location\n3-box entry or scan\nhandleLocationConfirm, hasReservation| CONF[POST /api/puts/:id/confirm\napi/functions/puts.ts — confirmPut\nvalidate scanned === directed\nplacePallet atomic transaction\ncopies storageCode/size/zone onto pallet\ndelete Reservation\nwriteLog PUT or MOVE_PUT incl. wasStaged + verification]

    CONF --> CONF_OK{Result?}
    CONF_OK -->|LOCATION_MISMATCH| ERR_C1[Error: Wrong location\nfields cleared + re-focused\nmodal stays open]
    CONF_OK -->|NOT_FOUND\nreservation expired| EXPIRE_C[Warning: Reservation expired\nfull reset to entry]
    CONF_OK -->|OK, wasStaged true| PUT_SUCCESS_STAGED[Success: Put / Move complete — Staged\ninfo tone\nstopPolling\nhistory outcome → PUT or MOVE]
    CONF_OK -->|OK, wasStaged false| PUT_SUCCESS_EMPTY[Success: Put / Move complete — Empty\nwarning tone, still Info-blue message\nstopPolling\nhistory outcome → PUT or MOVE]

    ERR_C1 --> S2

    ACTION -->|Unassign button\nhandleUnassign, hasReservation only| UNASSIGN[POST /api/puts/:id/unassign\napi/functions/puts.ts — unassignPut\nrestore location to STAGED if wasStaged===true, else EMPTY\ndelete Reservation atomic]

    UNASSIGN --> UN_OK{Result?}
    UN_OK -->|NOT_FOUND| EXPIRE_U[Warning: Reservation expired\nfull reset]
    UN_OK -->|OK| UN_SUCCESS[Info: Reservation cleared — Staged/Empty shown\nhistory outcome → RELEASED\nreset to entry — locked overrides kept]

    ACTION -->|Hold Location button\nhasReservation only\n#151 — replaces the old Blocked Put entirely| HOLD_OPEN[Nested modal embeds the shared\nHoldPanel — same component PIP/MNP/WLH use\nlocationId = directedLocation]

    HOLD_OPEN --> HOLD_SUBMIT[PATCH /api/locations/:id/hold\napi/functions/locations.ts — placeHold\nLogic Gate CLEAR_LOCATION — override EMPTY\nRESERVED location's Reservation is deleted\nas a side effect of placing the hold, #149]

    HOLD_SUBMIT --> HOLD_OK{Result?}
    HOLD_OK -->|FORBIDDEN| ERR_HOLD[Error: no permission for this hold type\nHold sub-modal stays open]
    HOLD_OK -->|OK| HOLD_SUCCESS[Success: hold type placed on location\nreservation already gone server-side —\nonHoldDone needs no API call of its own\nhistory outcome → HELD\nfull reset to entry, no auto-continue]

    ERR_HOLD --> HOLD_OPEN

    ACTION -->|Exists Elsewhere button\nHand Put + IM+ only, either hasReservation state —\nXS match found via GET /api/items/dpci/:dpci/locations,\nfiltered to size===XS and currentCartons>0 at fetch time,\nnot-the-current-target at render time on every toggle| EXISTS_OPEN[Popup lists each same-DPCI XS\nmatch — location + Storage Code badge\n+ current carton count, scrollable]

    EXISTS_OPEN --> EXISTS_PICK{Worker picks a row —\nnever completes the put by itself}
    EXISTS_PICK -->|hasReservation still true\nfirst redirect for this pallet| EXISTS_UNASSIGN[POST /api/puts/:id/unassign\nsame call Unassign itself uses]
    EXISTS_UNASSIGN --> EXISTS_UN_OK{Result?}
    EXISTS_UN_OK -->|Fails| ERR_EXISTS[Error: nothing lost\nreservation still held\npopup stays open for retry] --> EXISTS_OPEN
    EXISTS_UN_OK -->|OK| EXISTS_RETARGET
    EXISTS_PICK -->|hasReservation already false\nsubsequent pick — no API call| EXISTS_RETARGET

    EXISTS_RETARGET[Retarget directed at picked row\ndirectedLocation/directedLocationStorageCode updated\nhasReservation → false\noriginal snapshot captured on the FIRST redirect only\nmodal stays open — Unassign/Hold Location replaced by\nCancel, plus Return to Original once away from it]

    EXISTS_RETARGET --> ACTION

    ACTION -->|Confirm Location\n3-box entry or scan\nhandleLocationConfirm, not hasReservation| CONF2{Scanned Aisle+Bin\nmatches current target?}
    CONF2 -->|No| ERR_C1
    CONF2 -->|Yes, target is original| CONF_ORIG[POST /api/puts/manual/confirm\nresolution: proceed — plain EMPTY/STAGED,\nsame shape MNP's own plain put/move uses]
    CONF2 -->|Yes, target is a picked candidate| CONF_PICK[POST /api/puts/manual/confirm\nresolution: consolidate]

    CONF_ORIG -->|Fails| ERR_REDIR[Error: Confirm failed — please try again\nfully retryable, nothing lost — the original\nreservation was released at the FIRST redirect,\nwell before this attempt] --> S2
    CONF_ORIG -->|OK| PUT_SUCCESS_STAGED
    CONF_PICK -->|Fails| ERR_REDIR
    CONF_PICK -->|OK| EXISTS_SUCCESS[Success: Redirected — consolidated into location\nwriteLog CONSOLID\nhistory outcome → PUT or MOVE\nfull reset to entry]

    ACTION -->|Cancel button\nnot hasReservation| CANCEL[No API call — nothing left to release\nhistory outcome → RELEASED\nreset to entry]

    ACTION -->|Return to Original button\nnot hasReservation, away from original| RETURN_ORIG[Retarget directed back at original\nlocation + Storage Code — no API call] --> ACTION

    PUT_SUCCESS_STAGED --> RESET_N[Partial reset\nclear pallet + confirm\nnon-locked overrides cleared\nfocus → pallet field]
    PUT_SUCCESS_EMPTY --> RESET_N
    RESET_N --> S1

    UN_SUCCESS --> S1
    HOLD_SUCCESS --> S1
    EXISTS_SUCCESS --> S1
    CANCEL --> S1
    EXPIRE_C --> S1_FULL[Full reset — all fields cleared\nfocus → aisle field]
    EXPIRE_U --> S1_FULL
    S1_FULL --> S1

    style START fill:#1a1a1a,stroke:#555,color:#fff
    style PUT_SUCCESS_STAGED fill:#003300,stroke:#006600,color:#fff
    style PUT_SUCCESS_EMPTY fill:#003300,stroke:#006600,color:#fff
    style UN_SUCCESS fill:#003333,stroke:#006666,color:#aaffff
    style HOLD_SUCCESS fill:#003333,stroke:#006666,color:#aaffff
    style EXISTS_SUCCESS fill:#003300,stroke:#006600,color:#fff
    style CANCEL fill:#003333,stroke:#006666,color:#aaffff
    style ERR_P1 fill:#330000,stroke:#660000,color:#ff8080
    style ERR_P4 fill:#330000,stroke:#660000,color:#ff8080
    style ERR_P5 fill:#330000,stroke:#660000,color:#ff8080
    style ERR_P2 fill:#330000,stroke:#660000,color:#ff8080
    style ERR_P3 fill:#330000,stroke:#660000,color:#ff8080
    style ERR_C1 fill:#330000,stroke:#660000,color:#ff8080
    style ERR_HOLD fill:#330000,stroke:#660000,color:#ff8080
    style ERR_EXISTS fill:#330000,stroke:#660000,color:#ff8080
    style ERR_REDIR fill:#330000,stroke:#660000,color:#ff8080
